WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Read the quoted unit. Synthetic execution. A quoted option price is not the total execution premium.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Let the units cancel. Price per share × the stated multiplier × contract count gives total premium.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Keep interpretation separate. Premium is dollars exchanged, not conviction, ownership, or a price forecast.
